[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Orange County Public Works Drainage Model
Newport Bay Hydrology and Water Quality
Authors: Andrea Zimmer, Constantine Karos, Zach Eichenwald
Developed, calibrated, and validated by CDM Smith
Coordinate system: NAD83 CA State Plane VI feet
File name: Newport_Baseline_WithLID_20190312.inp
Last updated: March 12 2019
Closed conduit geometry from OCPW GIS database. Irregular pipe sizes may need field confirmation. Open channel conduit geometry estimated from DEM. Inverts infered from DEM and adjusted to eliminate adverse and steep slopes and to match NTS as-builts. NTS and flood control basin representation based on available as-built drawings.
All NTS sites and reservoirs contain fraction removal of key contaminants based on wetland basin. Boundary contaminant inflows and dry weather flows are estimated based on OCPW Dry Weather Flow Monitoring program data.
Add LID and LID treatment to underdrain.
`

